<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`PRIM_TYPE_TUBE: number = 5`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer PRIM_TYPE_TUBE = 5;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant PRIM_TYPE_TUBE has the value 5</p>
  <p>PRIM_TYPE_TUBE is a parameter of <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_TYPE" target="_blank">PRIM_TYPE</a> used to make prim into a tube and to change specific properties that define the shape of that tube.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
