</div>
  <h2>PRIM_TYPE</h2>
  <p><b> <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_TYPE" target="_blank"> [PRIM_TYPE</a>, PRIM_TYPE_TUBE,&#32;<a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank">integer</a> hole_shape, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Vector" target="_blank">vector</a> cut, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Float" target="_blank">float</a> hollow, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Vector" target="_blank">vector</a> twist, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Vector" target="_blank">vector</a> hole_size, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Vector" target="_blank">vector</a> top_shear, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Vector" target="_blank">vector</a> advanced_cut, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Vector" target="_blank">vector</a> taper, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Float" target="_blank">float</a> revolutions, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Float" target="_blank">float</a> radius_offset, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Float" target="_blank">float</a> skew ] </b></p>
